which category a visitor fits into. This allows us to offer the visitor content that matches their profile, based on visiting behaviour. — OnlineAfspraken.nl OnlineAfspraken.nl booking widget oa-dao-Resource* Stores the list of bookable resources, such as staff or rooms, that the appointment widget can offer. — oa-dao-ConsumerForm* Stores the layout and field definitions of the booking form, not the details you enter. — oa-dao-AppTypeGroup* Stores the categories used to group appointment types in the booking widget. — oa-booking Stores the details of the appointment you are currently booking. — oa-dao-* Stores appointment widget reference data on your device so the booking form does not have to reload it on every visit. — oa-application-widget-booking-consumerwidget-state Stores technical state the booking widget needs to work. — oa-dao-Mailing-MailingList-* Stores a mailing list that the appointment widget can offer you to subscribe to. — oa-configHash Stores a code used to check whether the booking widget has changed, so out-of-date saved booking data can be cleared. — oa-consumer Stores the identity of the signed-in customer for the booking. — oa-dao-AppType* Stores the list of appointment types the booking widget can offer. — oa-shoppingcart Stores the items you have added to your booking basket. — Analytics These cookies and similar technologies collect information about how visitors use our website, such as which pages are visited most, whether errors occur, and how users interact, to help us measure performance and improve the site. Google Google Analytics _ga ID used to identify users 2 years FPID Registers statistical data on users' behaviour on the website. Used for internal analytics by the website operator. — FPLC This FPLC cookie is the cross-domain linker cookie hashed from the FPID cookie. It’s not HttpOnly, which means it can be read with JavaScript. It has a relatively short lifetime, just 20 hours. — _ga_* ID used to identify users 2 years eur.nl Website *__ga_* Keeps tr"
